"for These Books:"
msgstr "对这些书籍使用序列布局\n"
"："

#: temp.glade:30943
msgid "List of diglot books not to be merged, to come one after the other"
msgstr "未合并的 diglot 图书列表，将陆续推出"

#: temp.glade:30955
msgid "FRT BAK GLO XXA XXB"
msgstr "FRT BAK GLO XXA XXB"

#: temp.glade:30957
